# Python SDK

Install the package in the environment that runs your agent:

```bash
pip install tracify-sdk
```

```python
from tracify import Tracify

tracify = Tracify(api_key="tracify_sk_live_...")

@tracify.trace(name="support-agent")
def answer(question: str):
    with tracify.span("retrieval"):
        context = search_docs(question)
    return llm.complete(question, context=context)
```

Set `TRACIFY_API_KEY` in production and attach session, user, environment, and release metadata when those dimensions matter to debugging.
